Subject: [PATCH 06/12] mmc: meson-mx-sdio: Fix misuse of GENMASK macro
Date:   Tue,  9 Jul 2019 22:04:19 -0700
Message-Id: <94dcbeb13b08a67ae9f404aa590c1c1459bc5287.1562734889.git.joe@perches.com>
